File icons harness-native draws for files and folders (src/drawing.rs reads each SVG into filled and stroked layers in
their own colours; harness-native-ui-inline's files.rs says which file kind is drawn with which).

The SVG file icons in this folder are from IntelliJ IDEA Community's New UI icon set:
https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community at 6df68efff3363b03362d0c406a591d4429c6669c,
platform/icons/src/expui/fileTypes, platform/icons/src/expui/nodes and platform/icons/src/language.

