The files are unchanged; `<name>_dark.svg` is the dark-appearance variant of `<name>.svg` (gitignore.svg has none and
is drawn in both). They came by way of den (github.com/andrewgazelka/den, crates/den-native/icons/jetbrains), and the
rest straight from the commit above, fetched 2026-11-06:
  expui/fileTypes: archive, binaryData, c, config, cpp, csv, docker, editorConfig, font, graphql, h, java, sql,
                   swiftLang, terraform, xml
  expui/nodes:     folderGithub
  language:        kotlin, ruby

The exceptions, which are not IntelliJ's files:
- folderOpen.svg and folderOpen_dark.svg are den's (the set has no open folder), drawn from folder.svg and
  folder_dark.svg on the same grid with the same stroke and colours; Apache 2.0, as folder.svg.
- lockFile.svg and lockFile_dark.svg are harness's: text.svg with its lower lines cut short under the lock badge of
  expui/nodes/locked.svg (the set has no lock file), same grid and colours; Apache 2.0, as both.
- nix.svg and nix_dark.svg are harness's: the NixOS snowflake from Simple Icons (simple-icons 16.36.0,
  https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@16.36.0/icons/nixos.svg, CC0 1.0), inset on its grid to the ink of the
  icons beside it, in NixOS's blues (the set has no Nix icon).
